      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The horse (Equus ferus caballus) is a domesticated, one-toed, hoofed mammal
    belonging to the family Equidae, which also includes zebras and donkeys.  Historically
    domesticated in Central Asia around 4000\u20133500 BCE, horses have been integral
    to human civilization, serving in agriculture, warfare, transportation, and modern
    sports. \r\n\r\n"
